  ItemName: Pendulum Suspension Pin
  ItemDescription: The pendulum didn't snap. Its suspension pin was <b>drawn out
    by hand</b>, and the fresh oil is smeared by fingers that were shaking. A trail
    of spilled tea runs straight here from the desk. Whoever pulled it came from
    Vance's chair.
